  startText: WATCH OUT
  elevatorGoneText: "Where\u2019s your way out now?"
  elevatorAppearText: GO BACK
  hallwayTexts:
  - "You think you\u2019re escaping?"
  - It can see you
  - Stop going forward
  - You never learn, do you?
  - '11     1                1

    1  11     111      1

    1      1111111                  
    1        1'
  - Keep walking. See where that gets you.
  - You are in a dream
  - Someone was killed here
  - Listen to me or you'll die
  - I know the truth
